</svg></div><div class="text-block-9">Zaustavi audio</div></a></div></div></div><div data-hero-variant="mobile" class="heroheader05_image-wrapper mobile-view-image margin-bottom margin-medium"><div class="image-group"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64de37518e83a4cbf88b7e90_Povratak-u-bucnost.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" height="" width="500" alt="Abak - antički kalkulator" data-srcset="/assets/images/final/64de37518e83a4cbf88b7e90_Povratak-u-bucnost.png 900w" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 93vw, (max-width: 767px) 96vw, (max-width: 991px) 84vw, 100vw" class="heroheader05_image hero-image-size"/><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="image background" class="image-background hidden-image-background"/><div class="w-layout-hflex ar-and-copyright"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64db374e19c92a97dd217809_AR ikona - s.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="irene stvarnosti" class="image-2"/><div class="text-copyright-or-title">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div></div><div class="qr-and-instructions tablet"><div class="qr-container"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64da230b62786b295daa9ab5_image.png" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Kad su riješeni problemi koji su se javljali u izradi kalkulatora uvidjelo se da se pomoću istih principa i tehnologije mogu napraviti i uređaji koji imaju više funkcija i širu primjenu. <br/><br/>Zato su se krajem 20. stoljeća počeli izrađivati uređaji koji su imali kombinaciju kalkulatora, adresara, rokovnika te sličnih aplikacija. <br/><br/>Svi ti uređaji mogli su učitavati nove aplikacije, koje su umanjile važnost kalkulatora, pa danas nemate kalkulator s telefonom, nego telefon koji sadrži i kalkulator.</div><div class="qr-and-instructions"><div class="qr-container"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da230b62786b295daa9ab5_image.png" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div><div data-hero-variant="desktop" class="heroheader05_image-wrapper"><div class="image-group"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64de37518e83a4cbf88b7e90_Povratak-u-bucnost.png" data-src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" height="" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 56vw" alt="Abak - antički kalkulator" data-srcset="/assets/images/final/64de37518e83a4cbf88b7e90_Povratak-u-bucnost.png 900w" class="heroheader05_image hero-image-size image-size-large"/><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" data-src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="image background" class="image-background image-background-opacity"/><div class="w-layout-hflex ar-and-copyright"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64db374e19c92a97dd217809_AR ikona - s.png" data-src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="irene stvarnosti" class="image-2"/><div class="text-copyright-or-title">Tradicionalni kineski abacus</div></div></div><div class="qr-and-instructions tablet"><div class="qr-container"><img fetchpriority="low" decoding="async" data-src="/assets/images/final/64da230b62786b295daa9ab5_image.png" data-src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" src="data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAAAAAP///ywAAAAAAQABAAACAUwAOw==" loading="lazy" alt="QR kod za AR iskustvo proširene stvarnosti" class="image qr"/><div class="text-block-3">Skeniraj kod mobitelom i uperi kameru u sliku da pokreneš AR.</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></header><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component"><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/64de2d9479d208d6bbc548a6_tetrafobija - broj četiri, smrt.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de2d9479d208d6bbc548a6_tetrafobija - broj četiri, smrt.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 31vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div><div id="w-node-_2de1299b-d9f3-7338-b8d8-274c918b1986-48dfbc51" class="layout58_content mobile-view-image"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Tetrafobija<br/></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/64de2d9479d208d6bbc548a6_tetrafobija - broj četiri, smrt.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de2d9479d208d6bbc548a6_tetrafobija - broj četiri, smrt.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 525px, 100vw" class="featured-image image-size-position"/></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Između PSION 3 i PSION 5 postojao je PSION REVO, a ne PSION 4. Naime, u zemljama Dalekog Istoka broj 4 se smatra nesretnim, a razlog leži u činjenici što se riječ smrt i riječ četiri slično izgovaraju (fonetski sei).<br/><br/>Stoga kompanije koje žele da njihovi proizvodi, uključujući kalkulatore, prosperiraju na tržištu Dalekog Istoka na razne načine prilagođavaju ovoj kulturološkoj posebnosti. <br/><br/>Fenomen nije ograničen samo na imena proizvoda, primjerice prilikom numeracije katova u zgradama također se izbjegava korištenje broja 4.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="section_layout58"><div class="page-padding"><div class="container-large-2"><div class="padding-vertical padding-xhuge"><div class="w-layout-grid layout58_component image-right"><div id="w-node-_2de1299b-d9f3-7338-b8d8-274c918b199f-48dfbc51" class="layout58_content"><div class="margin-bottom margin-xsmall"><h3 class="heading-medium">Lova do krova<br/></h3></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-image"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/64de2e1134c1092b42ab82cc_11 aukcija najskupljeg kalkulatora.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de2e1134c1092b42ab82cc_11 aukcija najskupljeg kalkulatora.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 479px) 77vw, (max-width: 767px) 72vw, (max-width: 991px) 525px, 100vw" class="featured-image image-size-position"/></div></div><div class="text-size-large-2">Iako su kalkulatori danas izgubili na prestižu i, u odnosu na neka stara vremena, prodaja im je drastično opala, ne znači da su izgubili na vrijednosti. <br/><br/>To najbolje pokazuje primjer njemačkog mehaničkog kalkulatora iz 19. stoljeća koji je 1993. na aukciji prodan za vrtoglavih 11.8 milijuna američkih dolara. Stari kalkulatori ipak mogu biti vrlo vrijedni.</div><div class="margin-top margin-medium"><div class="button-row-2 is-reverse-mobile-landscape"><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="button-secondary-gray w-inline-block"><div>Get started</div></a></div><div class="button-wrapper-3 max-width-full-mobile-landscape"><a href="#" class="uui-button w-inline-block"><div>Learn more</div></a></div></div></div></div><div class="layout58_image-wrapper mobile-view-hidden"><div class="featured-image-group"><img src="/assets/images/final/64da24687196d1736389be23_Pozadina za sliku.svg" loading="lazy" alt="image background" width="753" class="featured-image-background-left image-opacity"/><img src="/assets/images/final/64de2e1134c1092b42ab82cc_11 aukcija najskupljeg kalkulatora.png" loading="lazy" srcset="/assets/images/final/64de2e1134c1092b42ab82cc_11 aukcija najskupljeg kalkulatora.png 700w" alt="Dashboard mockup" sizes="(max-width: 991px) 100vw, 33vw" class="featured-image"/></div></div></div></div></div></div></section>